<title>USA: Case buys UK agricultural sprayer maker.</title>
<headline>Case buys UK agricultural sprayer maker.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Case Corp said Monday it had acquired Gem Sprayers Ltd, a privately owned maker of self-propelled and trailed-mounted agricultural sprayers.</p>
<p>Gem is the leading supplier of sprayers in the UK and had sales in its 1996 fiscal year of $12 million, Case said.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
